# CodeDrill app context

When working on files under `apps/app/`:

## At task start

1. Read `apps/app/docs/AGENTS.md` and follow its read order for context files under `apps/app/docs/context/`.
2. Read `apps/app/docs/context/progress-tracker.md` and align with **Current Goal** and **In Progress** — do not contradict shipped state in `apps/app/docs/prd.md`.

## While implementing

- Feature UI: `apps/app/features/<name>/` with `components/`, `hooks/`, `utils/` per `apps/app/docs/context/features-spec/01-design-system.md`.
- New features: add `apps/app/docs/context/features-spec/NN-<name>.md` and register in `00-index.md` (copy `99-feature-spec-template.md`).
- Primitives: `@repo/design-system` — not `apps/app/components/ui/`.
- Routes in `apps/app/app/` stay thin.

## Before marking work done

Update `apps/app/docs/context/progress-tracker.md` (Completed, Current Goal, In Progress, Next Up, Open Questions, Session Notes as needed) unless the user explicitly excludes doc updates.

Run `pnpm typecheck` from `apps/app` when the change touches types, routes, or shared modules.
